{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"warranty_2006 - warranty_2005","variables":{"warranty_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"millions"},"warranty_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"millions"}},"sources":{"warranty_2006":"source:q11n3","warranty_2005":"source:q11n4"}},"message":"Compute the change in the product warranty reserve from 2005 to 2006 as 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve. The source states the reserve was $10 million in 2006 and $4 million in 2005; both are in millions, so the difference is also in millions."}